@startuml
!theme plain
title HabitStack — System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

package "Mobile App (Flutter)" {
  [Habit Engine\n(micro-actions, stacks,\nstreaks on-device)]
  [2-Minute Timer]
  [Local Storage\nSQLite (drift)]
  [Sync Client]
  [Squad UI\n(anonymized states)]
}

package "Backend" {
  [Mobile Sync API\n(Fastify/Go)]
  database "Postgres" as DB {
    [users]
    [habit_profiles]
    [squad_memberships]
    [completion_events]
  }
  [Squad / Accountability\nService]
  [Push Notification\nWorker]
}

[Habit Engine] --> [Local Storage] : read/write (offline-first)
[2-Minute Timer] --> [Habit Engine] : log completion
[Habit Engine] --> [Sync Client] : queued changes
[Sync Client] --> [Mobile Sync API] : silent sync (LWW)
[Mobile Sync API] --> DB
[Squad / Accountability Service] --> DB : memberships, states
[Squad / Accountability Service] --> [Squad UI] : anonymized on-track/slipped
[Push Notification Worker] --> [Mobile App (Flutter)] : reminders
[Push Notification Worker] --> DB : scheduled jobs

note right of DB
  Sync is a mirror — the
  habit engine is the source
  of truth on-device.
end note

@enduml